    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ascend to become the best apocalypse lord on the universe!</strong><br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br>\u2022 3 Supernatural beings with different skills to cause an apocalypse.<br><br>\u2022 Upgrade your being, acquire new skills for him, and make it increasingly more powerful.<br><br>\u2022 In addition to their own skills, there are global skills that work independently of your being.<br><br>\u2022 Unlock amulets from other beings to combine their skills with your chosen one.<br><br>\u2022 Thousand of enemies to fight against, they never stop coming!<br><br>\u2022 Transform defeated enemies into minions so they join the fight on your side.<br><br>\u2022 Online leaderboards to compete with other players. Can you be the best?",
